# Agent context budget

This repo is a peer root in all three Monolith workspaces (`Monolith-Backend`, `Monolith-SPA`, `Monolith-Fullstack`), so this `AGENTS.md` and its five always-on rules inject on **every** turn in those workspaces. Keep them small.

| Task | Open |
|------|------|
| Edit a page | That page, plus `docs-coverage.json` when the capability is new |
| Add a product or section | `sidebars.ts`, `docusaurus.config.ts`, one existing page as the shape reference |
| Cross-repo page | The page, the manifest entry, and the sibling file that owns the behavior |

- Never `Read` the whole `docs/` tree or the whole `sidebars.ts`. Grep the page path or the heading you need.
- Never `@folder` or `@docs` in a prompt.
- One page per concern; a page that outgrows its topic splits into two pages and a sidebar group, not one long page.
- Target: a `[content]` task stays well under 30k tokens.
